# InfraLab

Infrastructure management platform.

## Purpose

InfraLab is a portafolio project designed to demonstrate system administration, backend development, containerization, monitoring, Kubernetes and CI/CD skills.

## Currente version

0.1.0

## Technologies

- Python
- FastAPI
- Git
- GitHub

## Current features

- Health check
- API information
- Server endpoint

